      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We sincerely appreciate you bringing this to our attention, and we are genuinely sorry for the frustration this situation has caused you. Please know that your experience is incredibly important to us, and we are absolutely committed to making this right for you right away. We are taking immediate steps to resolve this issue to your complete satisfaction, and we value your continued partnership with Vanguard immensely.",
